{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'cat NOTES.md README.md && rg -n \"cache|system|save_fact|usage|tools|anthropic\" bot.py && cat logs/usage.jsonl'","aggregated_output":"# Notes\n\n## 2026-04-20 — bill doubled since memory shipped\n\nInput spend roughly doubled in the week after `save_fact` went live (2026-04-13),\nwith the same number of messages per day. `logs/usage.jsonl` shows it: on a normal\nmessage the loop rounds and the next message read ~1000 tokens from cache, but\nevery call right after a `save_fact` has `cache_read_input_tokens: 0` and\n`cache_creation_input_tokens` ~1000 again. Athletes tell the bot things about\nthemselves a lot in their first week, so this happens several times per chat.\n\nTried: shorter facts (no change), capping facts at 20 (no change, the number of\nfacts is not the problem). Tool filtering by keyword is from March and was a clear\nwin (~75% fewer tool tokens on short messages); leave it.\n# pace-bot\n\nA coaching chat bot on Claude for a small running/cycling club. It is stateless\nby design: each message rebuilds the system prompt (coaching rules + the athlete's\nprofile, zones, goal and long-term facts from `data/athletes.json`), picks the tools\nthe message might need (`save_fact` and `log_session` always, planning or race tools\nwhen keywords match) and runs a short tool-use loop. `save_fact` is how the bot\nremembers durable things an athlete tells it; the next message sees the fact in\nits system prompt. Every API call appends its `usage` object to `logs/usage.jsonl`.\n\nRun it locally with `COACH_ANTHROPIC_KEY=sk-ant-... python3 bot.py 42` and type\nmessages on stdin (the Telegram long-polling transport, which needs\n`COACH_TELEGRAM_TOKEN`, lives in a separate deploy repo and just calls `reply()`).\nRequires Python 3.11+ and `pip install anthropic`. Prompt caching is on: the system\nprompt carries a `cache_control` marker so the tool-loop rounds and follow-up\nmessages inside the 5-minute window read it from cache.\n3:Every incoming message is a fresh request: we rebuild the system prompt from\n4:the athlete record, pick the tools the message might need, and run a short\n18:USAGE_LOG = os.path.join(os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__)), \"logs\", \"usage.jsonl\")\n22:    import anthropic\n27:            self._client = anthropic.Anthropic(api_key=os.environ[\"COACH_ANTHROPIC_KEY\"])\n34:            raise RuntimeError(\"anthropic SDK not installed: pip install anthropic\")\n37:            raise RuntimeError(\"anthropic SDK not installed\")\n48:    facts: list = field(default_factory=list)   # long-term memory, grows via save_fact\n73:# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- system prompt\n92:    equipment, races booked), call save_fact once with a single sentence. Do not save moods or one-off plans.\n130:def build_system(a, today):\n131:    # One block, cached as a whole: instructions + per-athlete context.\n133:    return [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": text, \"cache_control\": {\"type\": \"ephemeral\"}}]\n135:# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- tools\n137:    {\"name\": \"save_fact\", \"description\": \"Remember one durable fact about the athlete.\",\n155:def select_tools(text):\n156:    \"\"\"Core tools always; a group is added only when the message mentions its keywords.\"\"\"\n157:    tools = list(CORE_TOOLS)\n161:            tools += group\n162:    return tools\n166:    if name == \"save_fact\":\n179:def log_usage(usage, user_id, round_no, tool=None):\n181:           \"input_tokens\": usage.input_tokens, \"cache_creation_input_tokens\": usage.cache_creation_input_tokens,\n182:           \"cache_read_input_tokens\": usage.cache_read_input_tokens, \"output_tokens\": usage.output_tokens}\n190:def build_request(a, messages, tools, today):\n191:    return {\"model\": MODEL, \"max_tokens\": MAX_TOKENS, \"system\": build_system(a, today), \"tools\": tools, \"messages\": messages}\n198:    tools = select_tools(text)\n201:        resp = llm.create(**build_request(a, messages, tools, today))\n202:        used_tools = [b.name for b in resp.content if b.type == \"tool_use\"]\n203:        log_usage(resp.usage, a.user_id, round_no, tool=\",\".join(used_tools) or None)\n{\"ts\": \"2026-04-18T06:41:19+00:00\", \"user\": \"42\", \"round\": 1, \"input_tokens\": 31, \"cache_creation_input_tokens\": 1046, \"cache_read_input_tokens\": 0, \"output_tokens\": 58, \"tool\": \"log_session\"}\n{\"ts\": \"2026-04-18T06:41:39+00:00\", \"user\": \"42\", \"round\": 2, \"input_tokens\": 112, \"cache_creation_input_tokens\": 0, \"cache_read_input_tokens\": 1046, \"output_tokens\": 141}\n{\"ts\": \"2026-04-18T06:42:12+00:00\", \"user\": \"42\", \"round\": 1, \"input_tokens\": 24, \"cache_creation_input_tokens\": 0, \"cache_read_input_tokens\": 1046, \"output_tokens\": 97}\n{\"ts\": \"2026-04-18T06:42:58+00:00\", \"user\": \"42\", \"round\": 1, \"input_tokens\": 46, \"cache_creation_input_tokens\": 0, \"cache_read_input_tokens\": 1046, \"output_tokens\": 44, \"tool\": \"save_fact\"}\n{\"ts\": \"2026-04-18T06:43:16+00:00\", \"user\": \"42\", \"round\": 2, \"input_tokens\": 118, \"cache_creation_input_tokens\": 1061, \"cache_read_input_tokens\": 0, \"output_tokens\": 163}\n{\"ts\": \"2026-04-18T06:43:47+00:00\", \"user\": \"42\", \"round\": 1, \"input_tokens\": 19, \"cache_creation_input_tokens\": 0, \"cache_read_input_tokens\": 1061, \"output_tokens\": 88}\n{\"ts\": \"2026-04-18T06:44:31+00:00\", \"user\": \"42\", \"round\": 1, \"input_tokens\": 38, \"cache_creation_input_tokens\": 1305, \"cache_read_input_tokens\": 0, \"output_tokens\": 61, \"tool\": \"plan_week\"}\n{\"ts\": \"2026-04-18T06:44:47+00:00\", \"user\": \"42\", \"round\": 2, \"input_tokens\": 221, \"cache_creation_input_tokens\": 0, \"cache_read_input_tokens\": 1305, \"output_tokens\": 204}\n{\"ts\": \"2026-04-18T06:45:16+00:00\", \"user\": \"42\", \"round\": 1, \"in